# Generated OpenAPI spec (swaggo/swag). Regenerate with:
#   go tool swag init -g cmd/api/main.go -o cmd/api/docs
cmd/api/docs/

# Compiled command binaries. `go build ./cmd/<name>/` drops the executable here
# named after the package, which is easy to commit by accident — one did get
# committed once, at ~9 MB. Anchored per command rather than a blanket rule so a
# real source file can never be masked by it.
/api
/seed
/simscan

# Built SPA bundle copied in for prod (dev uses go/www placeholder).
